   7:Core/Src/spi_task.c **** /* SPI task: receives 2-byte packets from the Raspberry Pi 4 (SPI master)
   8:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    and updates the shared audio effect parameters.
   9:Core/Src/spi_task.c **** 
  10:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    Packet format: [GESTURE] [INTENSITY]
  11:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    The RPi must be configured as SPI master (SPI_MODE_0, MSB first, 8-bit)
  12:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    to match the STM32 SPI2 slave configuration.
  13:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    SPI2 uses hardware NSS (SPI_NSS_HARD_INPUT) — the RPi CS line directly
  14:Core/Src/spi_task.c ****    controls transaction framing. */
  15:Core/Src/spi_task.c **** 
